        "filing_date": "2026-03-05",
        "offering_role": "operator_business",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "Though we ship our products globally, we operate primarily in two geographies: the U.S.",
        "start_character": 18310,
        "end_character": 18397
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001865107-26-000008",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001865107-26-000008-9aa167036ba3f241",
        "accession_number": "0001865107-26-000008",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-05",
        "offering_role": "operator_business",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We are subject to a variety of federal, state, and international laws and regulations governing privacy, data protection, and information security, including a growing number of comprehensive state privacy laws in the United States, the General Data Protection Regulation (\"GDPR\") in the European Union, and similar data protection laws in Australia, New Zealand, and other jurisdictions in which we operate or do business.",
        "start_character": 32222,
        "end_character": 32645
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001865107-26-000008",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001865107-26-000008-9aa167036ba3f241",
        "accession_number": "0001865107-26-000008",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-05",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "We also face competition from direct-from-manufacturer retailers and in-person stores and boutiques, including traditional retailers and fashion boutiques.",
        "start_character": 29607,
        "end_character": 29762
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001865107-26-000008",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001865107-26-000008-9aa167036ba3f241",
        "accession_number": "0001865107-26-000008",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-05",
        "offering_role": "operator_business",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "We are subject to federal, state, local, and foreign laws governing employment and labor practices, including laws relating to wages and hours, workplace safety, anti-discrimination, and employee benefits, which vary across the jurisdictions in which we operate.",
        "start_character": 34548,
        "end_character": 34810
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001865107-26-000008",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001865107-26-000008-9aa167036ba3f241",
        "accession_number": "0001865107-26-000008",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-05",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "We believe our brands are underpenetrated in the markets in which they operate.",
        "start_character": 13511,
        "end_character": 13590
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001865107-26-000008",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001865107-26-000008-9aa167036ba3f241",
        "accession_number": "0001865107-26-000008",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-05",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "We employ a corporate development team dedicated to the identification, evaluation and acquisition of brands, and we maintain a strong pipeline of potential targets, which typically includes multiple acquisition opportunities at differing stages of evaluation.",
        "start_character": 16497,
        "end_character": 16757
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001865107-26-000008",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001865107-26-000008-9aa167036ba3f241",
        "accession_number": "0001865107-26-000008",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-05",
        "offering_role": "operator_business",
        "confidence": 0.9,
        "statement": "We are committed to protecting the planet by addressing climate change, promoting circularity and improving the environmental impact of our packaging, business operations and factories.",
        "start_character": 28332,
        "end_character": 28517
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001865107-26-000008",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001865107-26-000008-9aa167036ba3f241",
        "accession_number": "0001865107-26-000008",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-05",
        "offering_role": "operator_business",
        "confidence": 0.9,
        "statement": "We are making on-trend fashion more sustainable and accessible to everyone by transitioning our products to be made with lower environmental impact.",
        "start_character": 27892,
        "end_character": 28040
      },
      {
